From: SantiPT007 <santiago.almendra.6g.23@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:33:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] firmware: search the venus firmware partition and dsp

Forward-ported from hmos2sweet 0008 (4.14 firmware_class.c) to firmware_loader/main.c on sm8350 5.4.
---
 drivers/base/firmware_loader/main.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/base/firmware_loader/main.c b/drivers/base/firmware_loader/main.c
index a504d50fa..e6d1fcc6e 100644
--- a/drivers/base/firmware_loader/main.c
+++ b/drivers/base/firmware_loader/main.c
@@ -446,6 +446,10 @@ static int fw_decompress_xz(struct device *dev, struct fw_priv *fw_priv,
 static char fw_path_para[256];
 static const char * const fw_path[] = {
 	fw_path_para,
+	/* HarmonyOS on venus: subsystem images (adsp, modem, cdsp...) from
+	 * the firmware partition, mounted by the vendor fstab */
+	"/vendor/firmware_mnt/image",
+	"/vendor/dsp",
 	"/lib/firmware/updates/" UTS_RELEASE,
 	"/lib/firmware/updates",
 	"/lib/firmware/" UTS_RELEASE,
